WEBVTT

00:10:58.079 --> 00:11:01.037
When you see a pseudoarcheological claim,

00:11:01.079 --> 00:11:06.662
be skeptical and know
that if you post about Atlantis,

00:11:06.704 --> 00:11:09.246
tweet about ancient aliens

00:11:09.287 --> 00:11:13.329
or forward a clip
from a pseudoarcheology TV show,

00:11:13.371 --> 00:11:15.662
even if it's not your intention,

00:11:15.704 --> 00:11:19.412
you may be promoting racism
and xenophobia.

00:11:19.454 --> 00:11:22.537
Also know that the past is alive.

00:11:22.579 --> 00:11:24.287
It is political,

00:11:24.329 --> 00:11:26.246
it is ever-changing

00:11:26.287 --> 00:11:30.454
and it influences our daily lives
in meaningful ways.